title: "AMBKidsJoy: A free bilingual Amharic–English interactive learning hub for Grades 1–7"
abstract: "Free, bilingual (Amharic/English) interactive learning hub and 3D animated lesson videos for children, built on the Grade 1–7 curriculum of the Amhara Region, Ethiopia, with original characters, songs and music."
